{"unit_id":"tag:0EW4:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n爆破方块（Blow up squares）在平坦性（Flatness）续论第<REF_0001>节中引入。使用固有基变换定理（proper base change theorem），可见有一个关于爆破方块（blow up squares）的 Mayer-Vietoris 型结果。\n\n","allowed_english":["Mayer-Vietoris"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Blow up squares","target_term":"爆破方块"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"proper base change theorem","target_term":"固有基变换定理"},{"source_term":"blow up squares","target_term":"爆破方块"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Blow up squares","target_term":"爆破方块","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"proper base change theorem","target_term":"固有基变换定理","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"blow up squares","target_term":"爆破方块","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
