{"unit_id":"tag:0GF5:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。则纤维化于群胚的范畴（category fibred in groupoids）\n<MATH_0002>\n其在<MATH_0003>上的纤维（fibre）范畴（category）是范畴（category）<MATH_0004>，由层（sheaves）组成，这些层在小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）上，该景属于<MATH_0005>；此纤维化范畴是群胚（groupoids）中的叠（stack）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"纤维化于群胚的范畴"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"纤维化于群胚的范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0GF5:proof","translation":"为证明此引理，验证平坦性（Flatness）续论引理<REF_0001>的条件（1）、（2）、（3）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n条件（1）成立，因为层（sheaves）可粘合（glueing）（且 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（coverings））。见景（Sites）引理<REF_0002>。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n为验证条件（2），设<MATH_0001>是满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）、固有态射（proper morphism），有限呈示（finite presentation）于<MATH_0002>之上，且<MATH_0003>仿射（affine）。则<MATH_0004>有下降（descent），依据引理<REF_0003>或引理<REF_0004>。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n条件（3）直接由更一般的引理<REF_0005>得到。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"glueing","target_term":"粘合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"glueing","target_term":"粘合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
